[36m[49m[-] generic bindings[39m
[34mView switching[39m
                           m [33mview-main           [39mShow main view
                           d [33mview-diff           [39mShow diff view
                           l [33mview-log            [39mShow log view
                           L [33mview-reflog         [39mShow reflog view
                           t [33mview-tree           [39mShow tree view
