[34mView manipulation[39m
                     <Enter> [33menter[39m               Enter and open selected line
                           < [33mback[39m                Go back to the previous view state
         <Down>, <Ctrl-N>, J [33mnext[39m                Move to next
           <Up>, <Ctrl-P>, K [33mprevious            [39mMove to previous
                         ',' [33mparent[39m              Move to parent
                       <Tab> [33mview-next           [39mMove focus to the next view
                     R, <F5> [33mrefresh             [39mReload and refresh view
                           O [33mmaximize            [39mMaximize the current view
                           q [33mview-close          [39mClose the current view
                 Q, <Ctrl-C> [33mquit[39m                Close all views and quit
[34mCursor navigation[39m
                           k [33mmove-up             [39mMove cursor one line up
                           j [33mmove-down           [39mMove cursor one line down
                 <PageUp>, - [33mmove-page-up        [39mMove cursor one page up
